                            <h3>Explore Who We Are</h3>
                            <h2>who we are </h2>
                            <p>GM Diamond Group is a trusted and leading real estate development company based in Surat.
                                Established in 2014, our company has been consistently delivering high-quality projects
                                across residential and industrial sectors. Our portfolio includes premium theme-based
                                villas, modern row house communities, and strategically located industrial developments.
                            </p>
                            <p>With a focus on innovation, craftsmanship, and customer satisfaction, we aim to create
                                spaces
                                that offer lasting value and elevate lifestyles. Every project we undertake reflects our
                                core values—integrity, quality, and commitment to excellence.</p>
                            <p>Over the years, GM Diamond Group has earned a strong reputation in the Surat real estate
                                market by delivering well-planned developments and maintaining transparent relationships
                                with our clients and partners. We believe in building more than just structures. We
                                build
                                trust, comfort, and sustainable communities that stand the test of time.</p>
